{"id":"b3e136a81a802ba72d9682a231678afff5f624b2","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239400","title":"gpt 对拼车的容忍度怎么样","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"my2492","excerpt":"OpenAI - @my2492 - 公司给员工采购，每人一个 200 刀的预算不够，希望 2-3 人一个号，会使用同一个出口 ip 来访问（公司搭建的独享 ip 梯子），使用官方桌面版在共享的员工电脑上登录，工作时间会并发使用。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>公司给员工采购，每人一个 200 刀的预算不够，希望 2-3 人一个号，会使用同一个出口 ip 来访问（公司搭建的独享 ip 梯子），使用官方桌面版在共享的员工电脑上登录，工作时间会并发使用。</p><p>之前听说反代的都被降额度了，我们不反代，只模拟一人多设备的场景，这个场景被风控的概率高吗</p></div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/容忍度\"><li></li> 容忍度</a><a href=\"/tag/共享\"><li></li> 共享</a><a href=\"/tag/风控\"><li></li> 风控</a></P><p><span>22 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-05 01:42:13 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049405\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6a1/2393/233073_normal.png?m=1572831959\" alt=\"heyjei\" data-uid=\"233073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/heyjei\">heyjei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 10:23:21 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>看并发吧，我一个人在三台设备上使用，没有问题。不过我同一时间只有 1 个并发（我不会同时使用三台电脑）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049474\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffb92102bde2adde7cc550ee9c54e03b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Rache1\" data-uid=\"325266\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rache1\">Rache1</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 10:32:03 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我们是 3 ～ 5 人共用，用了快三个月了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049495\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0a689724d3ca045f642f47eff6ec7fba?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dufldylan1\" data-uid=\"484027\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dufldylan1\">dufldylan1</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 10:34:41 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主要防内鬼。本来我们 3 人啥事么有，结果一姐妹嫌梯子太慢，用自己的。然后当天就被先重置密码，一周以内封号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049553\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ebb5/6511/606772_normal.png?m=1679037652\" alt=\"wayne3602\" data-uid=\"606772\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wayne3602\">wayne3602</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 10:42:03 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>容忍度很高，我们几个人一起用一个 plus 账号，没一点问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18049771\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1174/0640/429233_normal.png?m=1666572328\" alt=\"rogi\" data-uid=\"429233\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rogi\">rogi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 11:07:16 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>挺高的吧，我们公司 2 个 20x 的账号反代，也是同一个 IP 出口，一共 8 个同事在使用</p><p>另外我自己试过一个 plus ，给我 2 个朋友加上我自己一起使用，用网页端的也有，用 codex 的也有，都没封号</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18050471\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/98f6c48771a29112c6bc06062ed828bb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BenCoper\" data-uid=\"506738\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BenCoper\">BenCoper</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 14:00:54 +08:00\">22h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>10 个 20x ，整个 Team 在用。出口用的公司统一的 VPN 代理新加坡的，运行 3 个月了没问题。每个号并发限制 10 ，实际上看了下最高 7 。中位数 3</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18050477\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/98f6c48771a29112c6bc06062ed828bb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BenCoper\" data-uid=\"506738\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BenCoper\">BenCoper</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 14:02:09 +08:00\">22h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/BenCoper\">BenCoper</a> 要开号就正经开美区的用礼品卡订阅，Google 订阅也行但是看到 Google 订阅的美区有封号的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18050505\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 14:08:30 +08:00\">22h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>从上次 sub2api 降智事件就知道不能容忍了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18051202\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5e894c14702784ce36b190e53f95a92f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qiubo\" data-uid=\"403960\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qiubo\">qiubo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 15:58:26 +08:00\">20h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道是不是错觉，我感觉同时开多个聊天线程，GPT 那边会限速</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18051609\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6348/78d8/145308_normal.png?m=1778558535\" alt=\"dryadent\" data-uid=\"145308\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dryadent\">dryadent</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 17:18:39 +08:00\">18h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只找人事的人合拼，基本上没啥事，大家都是不是很高的并发</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18051862\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2aadd08fc12d1da753775aa0e381289b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yjiefl\" data-uid=\"559015\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yjiefl\">yjiefl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 18:44:55 +08:00\">17h 24m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这能够用？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18051989\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/441b/3874/438391_normal.png?m=1567104002\" alt=\"JerryZhi\" data-uid=\"438391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JerryZhi\">JerryZhi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 20:37:39 +08:00\">15h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我觉得是看并发，我在 1 台 win ，3 台不同国家的服务器上都登录了，其中一台还是 sub2api 分给 2 个朋友偶尔应急蹬一下，但几乎没有同时使用过，一切正常</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052009\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 21:01:54 +08:00\">15h 7m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还好吧，我和我媳妇一起用的，没有使用反代，在两个电脑登录的 Codex ，我女儿会同时开两条线用没啥问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052014\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f9db/1f0c/352613_normal.png?m=1538041648\" alt=\"Prezzy\" data-uid=\"352613\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Prezzy\">Prezzy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 21:04:30 +08:00\">15h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>共用账号不怕记录和隐私共享出去了？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052050\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/857de230e6ae086bd1a8e969724c4caa?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"phoenix380\" data-uid=\"656997\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/phoenix380\">phoenix380</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 21:37:50 +08:00\">14h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Prezzy\">Prezzy</a> 都是本地的呀，不用聊天，其他的 codex 都是 本地会话的。我司大概 20X 6 个人用。还没出过问题，就是确实也不太经用/之前 5.5 那会一个周能蹬掉 50% 就差不多了...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18052269\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a21b5da7873abfae6e4dba47203efb31?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"oneyenp\" data-uid=\"803857\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/oneyenp\">oneyenp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 01:42: